ItemList.razor:

```razor
@typeparam TItem

<ul>
    @foreach (var item in Items)
    {
        <li>@ItemTemplate(item)</li>
    }
</ul>

@code {
    [Parameter] public IEnumerable<TItem> Items { get; set; } = [];
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment<TItem> ItemTemplate { get; set; } = default!;
}
```

The page:

```razor
<ItemList Items="names">
    <ItemTemplate><b>@context.ToUpper()</b></ItemTemplate>
</ItemList>

@code {
    private string[] names = ["ana", "bo"];
}
```

**What does the list show?**

