practice.task:
`Panel` has two `RenderFragment` parameters: **`Header`** and **`Body`**.

```razor
@* Panel.razor *@
<section class="panel">
    <header>@Header</header>
    <div>@Body</div>
</section>

@code {
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Header { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Body { get; set; }
}
```

Write the page **`/orders`** that uses `Panel` with `<h2>Orders</h2>` in the header and `<p>No orders yet.</p>` in the body.

